# Snorry brand (app)

Before changing user-facing UI copy, colors, or tab labels, read [BRAND_GUIDE_APP.md](../../BRAND_GUIDE_APP.md).

## Vocabulary (hybrid)

- Tab: **Tonight** (not Monitor)
- Sessions / limits / start-stop: **recording** (not monitoring)
- Live session nav title: **Recording**
- Live session reassurance subline: **listening** ("We're listening for snores.")
- Do not rename Swift types (`MonitorViewModel`, `MonitoringUsageTracker`) or analytics keys for copy changes.

## Design tokens

Use [Theme.swift](../../Snorry/Utilities/Theme.swift). Marketing hex values are in BRAND_GUIDE_APP.md §2.
